    "setupNotes": [
      "Official 2.1.24 Space Age; one assembling machine 2 making concrete, no modules, red belts, fast inserters, one substation. WEST: stone bricks 24/min (top belt), water 473/min (pipe), iron ore 4.8/min (bottom belt); each belt may carry its item on either lane. EAST: one red belt exit on the bottom row, 45 concrete/min, on both lanes; it holds 8 when the consumer stops taking concrete, and the machine then stops by itself. Keep the two output arms where they are: one fills each lane of the exit. Supply electricity at the substation.",
      "Place this supplier west of the launch kit with its exit row (row 3 from its top) on the kit's concrete entrance row and join them with a straight red belt. One copy covers the kit (it plans on 25 concrete a minute).",
      "Feed stone bricks, iron ore and water at or above the panel figures; extra simply backs up on the entrance belts and in the pipe."
